      "id": "rules",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 2100,
      "height": 130,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "text": "Unknown write → reconcile first. Never blindly retry through another adapter.\nSafe cross-channel recovery requires a common provider operation or established non-execution.\nPurchase budget ≠ provider approval ≠ order acceptance ≠ fulfillment.\nNo raw secrets in model context. Sandbox lifetime ≠ executor lease. A restarted worker must reacquire current authority.",
      "originalText": "Unknown write → reconcile first. Never blindly retry through another adapter.\nSafe cross-channel recovery requires a common provider operation or established non-execution.\nPurchase budget ≠ provider approval ≠ order acceptance ≠ fulfillment.\nNo raw secrets in model context. Sandbox lifetime ≠ executor lease. A restarted worker must reacquire current authority.",
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
