      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 2100,
      "height": 55,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "text": "Proposed design • not implemented. PAP / PACT / Link are distinct optional integrations with separately verified contracts.\nA PAP browser-session assertion requires an agent-controlled browser. Our initial user-page WebMCP flow does not automatically satisfy that requirement.",
      "originalText": "Proposed design • not implemented. PAP / PACT / Link are distinct optional integrations with separately verified contracts.\nA PAP browser-session assertion requires an agent-controlled browser. Our initial user-page WebMCP flow does not automatically satisfy that requirement.",
